{"id":"chatcmpl-9572f835-b701-4fad-b7fd-94a24dfa9503","object":"chat.completion","created":1795246190,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"{\n  \"highlights\": \"The task required determining laterality of a finding in a medical image, where left/right confusion is a common pitfall. The successful strategy combined expert visual analysis with grounded localization and explicit use of image markers to confirm anatomical orientation. This cross-verification approach ensures accurate laterality assignment.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When a task involves spatial laterality (left/right), always verify orientation using image markers or metadata before answering.\",\n    \"For ambiguous visual findings, consult multiple independent analysis methods (e.g., expert description and grounded localization) to cross-check the conclusion.\",\n    \"In multiple-choice questions with laterality options, explicitly map the finding to the patient's anatomical side using standard radiological conventions.\",\n    \"When available, leverage tool outputs that provide coordinate-based localization to independently confirm the side of the finding.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical Imaging Analysis\": \"Always check for orientation markers (e.g., 'L' or 'R') and confirm patient side versus image side. Use multiple tools to localize findings and cross-verify laterality.\",\n    \"Multiple-Choice Question Answering\": \"For options differing only by laterality or spatial attribute, explicitly verify the attribute using at least two independent methods before selecting the answer.\",\n    \"Tool-Assisted Decision Making\": \"Combine outputs from different specialized tools (e.g., expert QA and grounded report) to increase confidence, especially when the task hinges on a single distinguishing feature.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm image orientation by locating any laterality markers (e.g., 'L' or 'R') and ensure you map patient left/right correctly.\",\n    \"Cross-check the finding's location using at least two independent methods (e.g., expert description and coordinate-based localization) before finalizing the answer.\"\n  ]\n}"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":468,"total_tokens":844,"completion_tokens":376,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":468},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":376}}}